A speaker (or fan) of ((Lojban language)).  Term coined by ((Mark Shoulson)).  Face it, it's a more amusing term than ((Lojbanist)).

Possibly from Esperanto ''Lojxbanano''?

No, not when I coined it.  I think I was reacting to the flap about ((lojbani)) sounding too eastern, and thought it was a funny-sounding name.  I don't remember thinking Esperanto at the time (but who knows?)

!!!¡Lojbanista!

'''''...or Lojbaneers.'''''
